{"messages":[{"content":"Executable task contract:\nJSON scalar values in this task are null, boolean, integer (excluding boolean), or string. No floating point or coercion is used. Scalar equality is type-sensitive. Malformed tasks are outside the valid-task domain.\nInput: `objects` and `places` are nonempty lists of distinct strings. `initial_locations` maps every object to an existing place. `agents` lists `{agent_id:string,initial_beliefs:{object:place_or_null},object_priority:[distinct_existing_objects]}` with distinct agent IDs; initial_beliefs contains every object, null denotes unknown, and explicitly supplied non-null beliefs may already be false. `events` is an ordered list of `{object:existing_object,to:existing_place,observed_by:[distinct_existing_agent_ids]}`. Every event updates the actual location of its object. Exactly the listed observing agents update that object's belief to to; all other beliefs retain their previous value. Process events in order. For each agent, false_belief_objects lists objects with a known belief differing from actual final location; unknown_objects lists objects with null belief. Sort both lists lexicographically. Its stated policy chooses the first object in object_priority with non-null final belief, returning `{type:\"search\",object:object_name,place:believed_place}`; if none exists return `{type:\"abstain\"}`. Return exactly `{actual_locations:final_location_map,agents:[{agent_id,beliefs:final_belief_map,false_belief_objects:[object_names],unknown_objects:[object_names],action:policy_action}]}` with agent rows in input order. Behavior follows these explicit observations and policies. No intentions, emotions, hidden psychological traits, or second-order beliefs are inferred.\nTask JSON:\n{\"kind\":\"agent_history\",\"objects\":[\"book\",\"key\"],\"places\":[\"desk\",\"drawer\",\"shelf\"],\"initial_locations\":{\"book\":\"desk\",\"key\":\"drawer\"},\"agents\":[{\"agent_id\":\"Ada\",\"initial_beliefs\":{\"book\":\"desk\",\"key\":\"drawer\"},\"object_priority\":[\"book\",\"key\"]},{\"agent_id\":\"Bex\",\"initial_beliefs\":{\"book\":null,\"key\":\"shelf\"},\"object_priority\":[]}],\"events\":[{\"object\":\"book\",\"to\":\"drawer\",\"observed_by\":[\"Ada\",\"Bex\"]},{\"object\":\"key\",\"to\":\"shelf\",\"observed_by\":[\"Ada\",\"Bex\"]},{\"object\":\"book\",\"to\":\"desk\",\"observed_by\":[\"Ada\",\"Bex\"]}]}","role":"user"},{"content":"{\"actual_locations\":{\"book\":\"desk\",\"key\":\"shelf\"},\"agents\":[{\"action\":{\"object\":\"book\",\"place\":\"desk\",\"type\":\"search\"},\"agent_id\":\"Ada\",\"beliefs\":{\"book\":\"desk\",\"key\":\"shelf\"},\"false_belief_objects\":[],\"unknown_objects\":[]},{\"action\":{\"type\":\"abstain\"},\"agent_id\":\"Bex\",\"beliefs\":{\"book\":\"desk\",\"key\":\"shelf\"},\"false_belief_objects\":[],\"unknown_objects\":[]}]}","role":"assistant"}]}
